{
  "name": "e2_operating_point_jetson",
  "description": "E2 on the Orin - latency, tails, throughput and energy at the operating point, R=3, plus the precision study. int8 is what a practitioner gets by default (TensorRT mixes in FP16 where its kernels are faster); int8_nofp16 is the honest head-to-head against a DPU that has no float path at all; fp16 is what one would actually deploy for a network this small; fp32 is the sanity check against the 2025 study.",
